@startuml
title So do hoat dong - Tim kiem va loc phong tro

|Nguoi dung|
start
:Nhap tu khoa hoac chon bo loc;
:Gui yeu cau tim kiem;

|He thong|
:Lay dieu kien loc;
:Kiem tra tu khoa va bo loc;
:Truy van danh sach bai dang cong khai;
if (Co ket qua?) then (Co)
